---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Tranquil Pond Roadmap — Doppel Studios"
	description="See what's coming next for Tranquil Pond."
>
	<section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2 text-center">Tranquil Pond Roadmap</h1>
		<p class="text-white/70 mb-10 text-center">Exciting things are coming to Tranquil Pond</p>

		<div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8">
			<p class="mb-6">
				This spring, April showers bring May flowers with Tranquil Pond's first Seasonal Update!
			</p>
			<p class="mb-3 font-semibold">Changes include:</p>
			<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-white/80 mb-6">
				<li>More flowers to progress through</li>
				<li>A seasonal update to the area around the pond</li>
				<li>A visiting creature players can interact with</li>
				<li>New audio tracks</li>
				<li>Night Mode</li>
				<li>Cloud Saves</li>
				<li>And more</li>
			</ul>
			<p class="text-pink-200">
				The price of Tranquil Pond's full version will increase when this update is released. Buy
				Pond+ now to get the Early Adopter price.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
